  accTitle: Roles and screens
  accDescr: From the landing page: Coordinator has Dashboard, Patients, Transport, Hospitals and 42-day follow-up. Patients has tabs for mothers, newborns, needs transport, no reply yet, blocked and barriers solved. Hospital has Intake and Hospitals, and New referral in the header. Family has My journey, My ride and map, What to bring, 42-day plan and Get help, which opens the family assistant. Patients and Intake open the patient chart.
  Start["Landing page /"]

  Start --> C[Care Coordinator]
  Start --> H[Hospital]
  Start --> F[Patient and family]

  C --> C1["Dashboard<br/>/coordinator"]
  C --> C2["Patients<br/>/patients"]
  C --> C3["Transport<br/>/transport"]
  C --> C4["Hospitals<br/>/network"]
  C --> C5["42-day follow-up<br/>/continuity"]

  H --> H1["Intake<br/>/facility"]
  H --> C4
  H --> H2["New referral<br/>/create, header button"]

  F --> F1["My journey<br/>/patient"]
  F --> F2["My ride and map<br/>?view=transit"]
  F --> F3["What to bring<br/>?view=checklist"]
  F --> C5
  F --> F5["Get help<br/>?view=support"]
  F5 --> F6["Family assistant<br/>/patient/assistant"]

  C2 --> R["Patient chart<br/>/referral/:id"]
  H1 --> R

